    - diaryTitle:
      - The Cure
      diaryTextDisplayState: 01
      diaryText:
      - "H-Na-C-Sb-I-H-\n\r\nU-Rg-Ne-C-Y-Na-\n\r\nSb-H-H-I-X\xD8-C-\n\r\nNa-Y-Rg-U-C-Ne-H-\n\r\nI-Sb-Na-Na-C-Y-\n\r\nDs-U-H-Rg-I-Ne-\n\r\nC 
